~ vending_machine
# step 2.356: Fiona's thought changes once Layla has told her about her favorite snack, and again once
# Fiona has given her something (layla_gift_given / layla_gift_loved come from layla_gifts.dialogue)
if Flags.get_level_flag("layla_gift_loved"):
	Player: (A vending machine. The only one in this building.)
elif Flags.get_level_flag("layla_gift_given"):
	Player: (The vending machine. I already got Layla something from here.)
elif Flags.get_level_flag("vending_layla_hint_heard"):
	Player: (The vending machine. Layla said she loves the Pink-pack protein bars in here.)
else
	Player: (A vending machine. The only one in this building.)
	if GameManager.is_companion_following() and Flags.get_game_counter("layla_closeness") >= 0:
		Layla notices you looking toward it.
		Layla: Oh! I love the Pink-pack protein bars they have in here!
		Layla: They're chewy and also... crunchy?
		Player: Oh. That's nice.
		Player: (Should I get it for her?)
		do Flags.set_level_flag("vending_layla_hint_heard", true)
=> END

